MPSQL v.9.0 - an interactive query tool for Postgres95,
similar to Oracle's Server Manager motif worksheet
and Microsoft's Windows based SQL Server iSQL query
tool has been uploaded to sunsite.unc.edu, it should
be available under /pub/Linux/apps/databases shortly.

