Hi,

For additional functionality, apply the following patch to
pppd-2.2.0d which will add the ability to autoconfigure WINS server
addresses.

Christoph's 3A instruction should then include:

Add a line
	wins-addr x.x.x.x
to your /etc/ppp/options file. Be sure to replace x.x.x.x with a
valid WINS server address.

P.S. The wins patch was posted to comp.protocols.smb 
     by John Paul Morrison, jmorriso@ConcordPacific.com

