Current News
- ------------
    
    Early next year Rich Maginn and his students will be presenting
    an Internet / Worldwide Web hands on workshop using the Smoky
    Hill network. This will be available to anyone who cares to
    attend that particular CLUE meeting. There may be a donation
    requested to help Smoky Hill buy more computer equipment, this
    has not yet been determined. More information to come, stay
    tuned!
    
