    newsletter, please send it to the editor, joel@mrg.uswest.com


Next Meeting Topic (Dec 21, 1995)
- ---------------------------------

    The December Topic will be by Joe Anthony, and Doug Fowler Dec
    21, 1995. A student perspective on Linux at Smoky Hill, What it
    is used for, how it fits, and how it benefits the Students now
