AND The UA Development Team                     ======================

Welcome to UN*X ATTACK .. a fast pased Tank Battle Game that supports up to
16 players on multiple platforms.  UN*X ATTACK! (or UA) is currently in
testing and pre-compiled clients are available to the general public. 

The theory behind UA is simple ... you defend your own base while
eliminating the other players.  To do this, you use tanks, mines, pods,
lasers, guns, neutrons (nukes! All good games have nukes!) .. and more.  The
current client for UA is curses based, allowing you to play from a
workstation, xterm, dialin connection, or even a dumb terminal.  Current
plans include an X version.  

UA is a fast pased game.  With up to 16 players and four active tanks per
player, UA can have a LOT going on at once!  You've got a lot to think about
.. or /react to/!  :)  Be the last one alive .. to win!

UA features an easy to use interface (with customizable keys), all necessary
data onscreenat all times, and a convient TALK/CHAT mode to allow you to
talk to your fellow players before and after the game.

When you first connect to UA, you'll end up in the TALK/CHAT mode.  If there
already is a game going on, someone's name will have GAME above it.  You'll
have to wait until everyone comes out of the GAME mode for a new game to
begin.  Otherwise, you are free (along with other users) to start a game. 
Please note that playing a game by yourself is not really that exciting, so
the server will only start a game when two or more players are on.

